.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-FLUENT-CURRENT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-fluent\-current \- Read a fluent snapshot from its exact graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu fluent current\fR [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-fluent\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read a fluent snapshot from its exact graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
HTTP(S) server origin without credentials, query or path
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Explicit graph IRI for this operation
.TP
\fB\-\-fluent\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Exact fluent IRI to read
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
